WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.190 --> 00:00:01.530
Mind your Decisions,

00:00:01.530 --> 00:00:03.370
I'm Presh Talwalkar.

00:00:03.370 --> 00:00:10.740
The American Invitational Mathematics Examination, or AIME for short, is a qualifying test in America for the

00:00:10.990 --> 00:00:12.700
International Mathematical Olympiad.

00:00:12.700 --> 00:00:18.209
It's a 3 hour test, with 15 questions, and calculators are not allowed.

00:00:19.090 --> 00:00:23.729
Every answer on the test is an integer from 0 to 999.

00:00:24.400 --> 00:00:26.199
Of interest is

00:00:26.199 --> 00:00:30.928
1984 AIME, problem 3, but lest you think the problem is outdated,

00:00:31.289 --> 00:00:35.999
it was also asked in 2019 to 14 year olds in Sweden.

00:00:37.000 --> 00:00:38.620
In triangle ABC,

00:00:38.620 --> 00:00:40.950
pick a point P on the interior.

00:00:41.920 --> 00:00:49.080
Construct lines through P that are parallel to the sides of ABC. Now these triangles have areas of

00:00:49.870 --> 00:00:51.870
4, 9, and 49.

00:00:52.270 --> 00:00:54.479
What is the area of triangle ABC?

00:00:55.420 --> 00:01:01.530
Pause the video if you'd like to give this problem a try, and when you're ready, keep watching to learn how to solve this problem.

00:01:14.560 --> 00:01:16.900
So there will be many ways to solve this problem,

00:01:16.900 --> 00:01:22.349
and if you want to share your solution method in the comments, you can use this labeling of the diagram.

00:01:23.140 --> 00:01:27.269
I think this is a little bit of an alphabet soup, so I'm going to explain it visually:

00:01:28.240 --> 00:01:35.069
Because the lines through P are parallel ,all triangles are similar to each other and they're similar to ABC.

00:01:36.520 --> 00:01:40.020
The area of a triangle is proportional to its side length squared.

00:01:40.600 --> 00:01:46.019
Another way of saying this is that the square root of the area is proportional to the side length of the triangle.

00:01:46.869 --> 00:01:52.019
The ratio of the areas of these three triangles is 4, 9, and 49.

00:01:52.659 --> 00:01:59.159
Because these triangles are similar to each other, the ratio of their sides will be the square root of the areas.

00:01:59.530 --> 00:02:02.369
this works out to be 2, 3, and 7.

00:02:03.640 --> 00:02:06.779
Suppose this side length is 2x.

00:02:07.630 --> 00:02:13.439
Because the triangles are similar, this side length will be 3x and this side length will be 7x.

00:02:14.500 --> 00:02:20.369
Because all sides are parallel, we have parallelograms, and these lengths will be equal to each other.

00:02:21.579 --> 00:02:26.819
Consequently, we can calculate that AC will have a length that's equal to 12x.

00:02:28.389 --> 00:02:36.239
The ratio of the sides between ABC and this yellow triangle will be 12 - 2, because it's 12x- 2x.

00:02:36.910 --> 00:02:39.239
This will simplify to be 6 to 1;

00:02:40.299 --> 00:02:48.149
consequently, the ratio of their areas will be 6^2 - 1^2, which works out to be 36 to 1, and now we

00:02:48.150 --> 00:02:52.530
can calculate the answer: the area of triangle ABC will be

00:02:52.840 --> 00:02:56.340
36 times 4, and therefore the answer is

00:02:57.400 --> 00:02:59.400
144.

00:02:59.799 --> 00:03:03.779
Thanks for making Mind Your Decisions one of the best channels on YouTube, and as

00:03:04.480 --> 00:03:07.950
always, thanks for watching and thanks for your support.

